  },
  {
   "Speaker": "",
   "Line": "se00007_b",
   "_kind": "Sound"
  },
  {
   "Speaker": "Ena",
   "Line": "<When do you think K and Yuki are gonna get back?>",
   "_kind": "talk"
  },
  {
   "Speaker": "",
   "Line": "bgm00038",
   "_kind": "Sound"
  },
  {
   "Speaker": "",
   "Line": "bg_h000303",
   "_kind": "Background Change"
  },
  {
   "Speaker": "Mizuki",
   "Line": "<No idea. They might end up having a pretty long conversation.>",
   "_kind": "talk"
  },
  {
   "Speaker": "Ena",
   "Line": "<Yeah, I get that...>",
   "_kind": "talk"
  },
  {
   "Speaker": "",
   "Line": "bg_e000301",
   "_kind": "Background Change"
  },
  {
   "Speaker": "Ena",
   "Line": "<I hope Yuki's able to tell her mom how she actually feels and stuff. Like that she wants to be listened to and understood.>",
   "_kind": "talk"
  },
  {
   "Speaker": "",
   "Line": "bg_h000303",
   "_kind": "Background Change"
  },
  {
   "Speaker": "Mizuki",
   "Line": "<I want to believe that she will.\nFortunately, K and her dad are there with her.>",
   "_kind": "talk"
  },
  {
   "Speaker": "Mizuki",
   "Line": "<And Yuki made it pretty clear that she wants to start moving forward.>",
   "_kind": "talk"
  },
  {
   "Speaker": "Ena",
   "Line": "<Yeah...>",
   "_kind": "talk"
  },
  {
   "Speaker": "",
   "Line": "bg_e000301",
   "_kind": "Background Change"
  },
  {
   "Speaker": "Ena",
   "Line": "<You know, you sound really calm about all this, Amia.>",
   "_kind": "talk"
  },
  {
   "Speaker": "",
   "Line": "bg_h000303",
   "_kind": "Background Change"
  },
  {
   "Speaker": "Mizuki",
   "Line": "<That's because you're feeling enough anxiety for the both of us.>",
   "_kind": "talk"
  },
  {
   "Speaker": "Mizuki",
   "Line": "<It's that thing where you feel better when you see someone else feeling more nervous than you!>",
   "_kind": "talk"
  },
  {
   "Speaker": "Ena",
   "Line": "<Gee, thanks...>",
   "_kind": "talk"
  },
  {
   "Speaker": "",
   "Line": "bg_e000301",
   "_kind": "Background Change"
  },
  {
   "Speaker": "Ena",
   "Line": "<Wait, K's typing something in chat...!>",
   "_kind": "talk"
  },
  {
   "Speaker": "",
   "Line": "bg_h000303",
   "_kind": "Background Change"
  },
  {
   "Speaker": "Mizuki",
   "Line": "<Huh?>",
   "_kind": "talk"
  },
  {
   "Speaker": "",
   "Line": "bg_e000401",
   "_kind": "Background Change"
  },
  {
   "Speaker": "",
   "Line": "se00007_b",
   "_kind": "Sound"
  },
  {
   "Speaker": "Mizuki",
   "Line": "<They're back?!\nOh, I think they're getting ready to hop in the call.>",
   "_kind": "talk"
  },
  {
   "Speaker": "",
   "Line": "se00084_b",
   "_kind": "Sound"
  },
  {
   "Speaker": "",
   "Line": "bgm00000",
   "_kind": "Sound"
  },
  {
   "Speaker": "",
   "Line": "bg_e000101",
   "_kind": "Background Change"
  },
  {
   "Speaker": "",
   "Line": "bg_h000303",
   "_kind": "Background Change"
  },
  {
   "Speaker": "Ena",
   "Line": "<Welcome back, you two.\nWe were just getting some work done and wondering when you'd be back.>",
   "_kind": "talk"
  },
  {
   "Speaker": "",
   "Line": "bg_e000101",
   "_kind": "Background Change"
  },
  {
   "Speaker": "Kanade",
   "Line": "<I see...>",
   "_kind": "talk"
  },
  {
   "Speaker": "",
   "Line": "bg_e000301",
   "_kind": "Background Change"
  },
  {
   "Speaker": "Ena",
   "Line": "<So, how'd it go...?\nOh, if it's okay for me to ask...>",
   "_kind": "talk"
  },
  {
   "Speaker": "",
   "Line": "bg_e000101",
   "_kind": "Background Change"
  },
  {
   "Speaker": "Kanade",
   "Line": "<Can I tell them, Mafuyu?>",
   "_kind": "talk"
  },
  {
   "Speaker": "Mafuyu",
   "Line": "<Yes...>",
   "_kind": "talk"
  },
  {
   "Speaker": "Kanade",
   "Line": "<Then...>",
   "_kind": "talk"
  },
  {
   "Speaker": "",
   "Line": "bg_h000303",
   "_kind": "Background Change"
  },
  {
   "Speaker": "",
   "Line": "bg_e000401",
   "_kind": "Background Change"
  },
  {
   "Speaker": "Mizuki",
   "Line": "<That's great...!\nIt sounds like your mom understands what you're going through!>",
   "_kind": "talk"
  },
  {
   "Speaker": "",
   "Line": "bgm00039",
   "_kind": "Sound"
  },
  {
   "Speaker": "",
   "Line": "bg_h000103",
   "_kind": "Background Change"
  },
  {
   "Speaker": "Mafuyu",
   "Line": "<Yes...>",
   "_kind": "talk"
  },
  {
   "Speaker": "",
   "Line": "bg_e000301",
   "_kind": "Background Change"
  },
  {
   "Speaker": "Ena",
   "Line": "(She sounds a lot different compared to when I spoke to her...)",
   "_kind": "talk"
  },
  {
