  },
  {
   "Speaker": "",
   "Line": "bg_e000303",
   "_kind": "Background Change"
  },
  {
   "Speaker": "Ena",
   "Line": "<So you can work without having to sneak around now.\nI'm really glad for you.>",
   "_kind": "talk"
  },
  {
   "Speaker": "",
   "Line": "bg_h000308",
   "_kind": "Background Change"
  },
  {
   "Speaker": "Mafuyu",
   "Line": "<Right...>",
   "_kind": "talk"
  },
  {
   "Speaker": "",
   "Line": "bg_h000107",
   "_kind": "Background Change"
  },
  {
   "Speaker": "Kanade",
   "Line": "<But try not to push yourself too hard. You only just got home today.>",
   "_kind": "talk"
  },
  {
   "Speaker": "",
   "Line": "bg_e000303",
   "_kind": "Background Change"
  },
  {
   "Speaker": "Ena",
   "Line": "<Oh, right.\nYour room is probably crammed full of boxes and stuff right now, huh?>",
   "_kind": "talk"
  },
  {
   "Speaker": "",
   "Line": "bg_h000308",
   "_kind": "Background Change"
  },
  {
   "Speaker": "Mafuyu",
   "Line": "<No, I've already cleaned everything up.>",
   "_kind": "talk"
  },
  {
