   "Line": "<What?!>",
   "_kind": "talk"
  },
  {
   "Speaker": "",
   "Line": "bg_e000403",
   "_kind": "Background Change"
  },
  {
   "Speaker": "Mizuki",
   "Line": "<Haha! That's Yuki for you!\nShe's the total opposite of you, Enanananan. I bet you hate cleaning up.>",
   "_kind": "talk"
  },
  {
   "Speaker": "",
   "Line": "bg_h000309",
   "_kind": "Background Change"
  },
  {
   "Speaker": "Ena",
   "Line": "<Excuse me? I do not hate cleaning! It's just a huge pain, so I don't do it!>",
   "_kind": "talk"
  },
  {
   "Speaker": "",
   "Line": "bg_e000210",
   "_kind": "Background Change"
  },
  {
   "Speaker": "Mafuyu",
   "Line": "<...>",
   "_kind": "talk"
  },
  {
   "Speaker": "Mafuyu",
   "Line": "<Nothing has changed...>",
   "_kind": "talk"
  },
  {
   "Speaker": "",
   "Line": "bg_h000309",
   "_kind": "Background Change"
  },
  {
   "Speaker": "Ena & Mizuki",
   "Line": "<Huh?>",
   "_kind": "talk"
  },
  {
   "Speaker": "",
   "Line": "bg_e000210",
   "_kind": "Background Change"
  },
  {
   "Speaker": "Mafuyu",
   "Line": "<Regardless of if I'm at Kanade's house or my own home, you two are still really obnoxious.>",
